KONOHAGAKURE — CERTIFICATE OF CLAN AFFILIATION

This certifies the registered clan lineage of the named shinobi for the purposes of inheritance, kekkei genkai documentation, and clan-law jurisdiction.

Sample certifications on file:
- Hyuga, Neji — Branch House of the Hyuga clan. Byakugan confirmed. Subject to Branch House caged-bird seal policy.
- Uchiha, Sasuke — Uchiha clan (surviving member). Sharingan eligibility on file.
- Akimichi, Choji — Akimichi clan, heir. Body Expansion techniques.
- Yamanaka, Ino — Yamanaka clan, heir. Mind-body techniques.
- Aburame, Shino — Aburame clan. Kikaichu host.

Clan affiliation grants access to clan-restricted jutsu archives and imposes clan-law obligations. Disputes of lineage are adjudicated by the respective clan head and the Village Council.

Certified by the Administration Building, Clan Registry.
